{
  "_comment": [
    "News and social sources. Every entry starts as status 'unverified'; pipeline step 5 tests each",
    "one and sets status to 'ok', 'no-feed' (no RSS exists), or 'broken'. Only 'ok' sources are fetched.",
    "url: null means the feed address still has to be found. Nothing here is invented: these are either",
    "addresses you suggested or standard public URL patterns (Google News, Reddit, Bluesky).",
    "cityHint: tags every item from that source with a city, even if the headline doesn't name it.",
    "To add a source: copy an entry, change name/url, set status to 'unverified', and it gets checked next run."
  ],

